    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n108537" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑποκείρω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>cut off below,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μύες . . τοὺς στάχυς . . ὑποκείροντες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ael.
					<u>NA</u>
					6.41
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				17.17
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>cut off, take away,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				1.327
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> metaph.,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑ. τοὺς χρεώστας</span>
			<i>tear, mangle</i> them, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.829a
			</span></i>.</div>
